<div class="phead"><div class="w" style="padding-left:96px"><ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="{{ PathBase }}/">Home</a></li><li>Matters</li></ol><p class="sn">§ 3 · The docket</p><h1>Representative matters</h1><p class="lede">{{ Target.TotalCount }} anonymized matters: the forum, the team and how each ended. Prior results do not guarantee a similar outcome.</p></div></div>
<section class="sec tight"><div class="w" style="padding-left:96px"><div style="display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:22px;font:500 12.5px var(--mono);color:var(--ink2)"><span>Stamps:</span><span class="stamp">Verdict</span><span class="stamp">Dismissed</span><span class="stamp">Award</span><span class="stamp">Affirmed</span><span class="stamp settled">Settled</span><span class="stamp closed">Closed</span></div><table class="docket"><thead><tr><th>No.</th><th class="hm">Year</th><th>Matter</th><th class="hm">Forum</th><th>Disposition</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for m in Target.Items %}{%- assign z=m.PublishedContent -%}{%- capture mc -%}{{ z.code }}{%- endcapture -%}{%- capture dp -%}{{ z.disposition }}{%- endcapture -%}{% if true %}<tr><td class="m">{{ z.docket }}</td><td class="m hm">{{ z.year }}</td><td><a class="t" href="{{ PathBase }}/{{ m.RoutePath }}">{{ m.PrimaryField }}</a><span class="r">{{ z.result }}</span></td><td class="hm" style="font-size:.92rem;color:var(--ink2)">{{ z.forum }}</td><td><span class="stamp {{ dp }}">{% capture dl -%}{{ z.disposition }}{%- endcapture %}{{ dl | replace: "verdict","Verdict" | replace: "settled","Settled" | replace: "dismissed","Dismissed" | replace: "closed","Closed" | replace: "award","Award" | replace: "affirmed","Affirmed" }}</span></td></tr>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</tbody></table><p class="fine">All matters, parties and docket numbers are fictional. Matters are described with client permission in the story.</p></div></section>
